  "id": "China_Nexus_Actor_Spies_on_US_Researchers_Undetected_for_a_Year_txt_4",
  "content": "The campaign, uncovered by the Google Threat Intelligence Group (GTIG), relied on using custom malware to steal credentials from a Web application widely used by researchers, as well as a novel technique to stealthily transfer data out of an IT environment. GTIG, working with Google subsidiary Mandiant Consulting, discovered and subsequently disrupted the sprawling operation, which targeted the network of a single medical university with ties to the US military, but affected numerous organizations, according to a report published Monday.",
